{"id":"29b1f351c8b815d1","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-no-delta02.md","title":"2 随机点不是 Δ₂⁰","display":"thm-2random-no-delta02 — 2 随机点不是 Δ₂⁰","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-2random-no-delta02","aliases":["43-thm-2random-no-delta02"],"display":"thm-2random-no-delta02 — 2 随机点不是 Δ₂⁰","depends_on":["[[43-df-2random]]","[[43-df-delta02]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-thm-nrandom-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.8，印刷192–193，PDF212–213","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-no-delta02"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-no-delta02</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-no-delta02 — 2 随机点不是 Δ₂⁰"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"801b1a72671fc17a\" href=\"?note=801b1a72671fc17a\" title=\"43-df-delta02\">43-df-delta02</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e358684550f1aca\" href=\"?note=4e358684550f1aca\" title=\"43-thm-nrandom-jump\">43-thm-nrandom-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.8，印刷192–193，PDF212–213"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^0_2\">\\(\\Delta^0_2\\)</span>、跳跃及归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"801b1a72671fc17a\" href=\"?note=801b1a72671fc17a\" title=\"43-df-delta02\">43-df-delta02</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。将X与特征函数相应的自然数集合识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow X\\nleq_T\\varnothing\\prime.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow X\\nleq_T\\varnothing\\prime.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以n=2代入相对非可计算性。结合极限引理即得到不是Δ₂⁰的表述。源书Theorem 9.7.8先以普通复杂度给出同一障碍。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.8，印刷192–193，PDF212–213。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","a